  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaterStarters DGBP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaterStarters uses an ecosystem approach to protect people, animals &amp; the environment from climate change impact. We start with sustainable access to safe &amp; affordable water through our climate-smart, financially sustainable water solutions, promoting economic growth and improve livelihoods. Franchisees and their communities, especially girls &amp; women, will become economically resilient and experience less climate-related water &amp; health issues. We also advocate for groundwater retain and recharge measures at county level to close the loop of a climate resilient water cycle.</narrative>
  </description>
